      "locked": false,
      "text": "推理本身有极限",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "推理本身有极限",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "Xjyx8kbh62oC78zZz8pFd",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -459.999302493012,
      "y": -471.59084424712455,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 27,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b11",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 717032899,
      "version": 310,
      "versionNonce": 1850599555,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1769584056657,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "形式化系统不能通过推理验证所有问题的真假",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "形式化系统不能通过推理验证所有问题的真假",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "jflbXOuHtvbQVkCKam5ps",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -456.5816345733617,
      "y": -439.45882860787924,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 27,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b12",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 335306083,
      "version": 324,
      "versionNonce": 1310973987,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1769584056657,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "数学上不存在一个完美的系统可以解答任何问题",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "数学上不存在一个完美的系统可以解答任何问题",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "0omZPaheQfs_F5tpHqf9p",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -459.9993025208785,
      "y": -408.5901210361985,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 27,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b13",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 602978563,
      "version": 600,
      "versionNonce": 463070147,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1769584056657,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "也就是说总有真命题在此系统下没有办法自动证明的",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "也就是说总有真命题在此系统下没有办法自动证明的",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "p5PxH8aiWBrG-oXjxiucn",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 45.93832367327184,
      "y": -534.5915689460317,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 27,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b14",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1478008995,
      "version": 577,
      "versionNonce": 1053717347,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1769584056657,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "形式系统无法自动解决一切问题",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "形式系统无法自动解决一切问题",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "oGz4jHWXdbNtPnOj88iR2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 57.54846175881437,
      "y": -489.5901207805864,
      "width": 256.77972412109375,
      "height": 189,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b15",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2049086531,
      "version": 305,
      "versionNonce": 403705603,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1769584056657,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "有限状态\n   ↓\n非图灵完备\n   ↓\n可判定\n   ↓\nSAT / SMT / Model Checking",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "有限状态\n   ↓\n非图灵完备\n   ↓\n可判定\n   ↓\nSAT / SMT / Model Checking",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "p64qVavXccR5iPkxWPolO",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1503.4590520525912,
      "y": -534.5915689112494,
      "width": 473.03997802734375,
      "height": 54,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b16",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 434967523,
      "version": 314,
      "versionNonce": 2044540579,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1769584056657,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "程序就是一个形式化系统,\n但没有办法设计一个程序去解决一切问题(如黎曼猜想)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "程序就是一个形式化系统,\n但没有办法设计一个程序去解决一切问题(如黎曼猜想)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "6sjhIsabqkyQoMAd0nfFN",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 371.87594992069705,
      "y": -495.1267921218014,
      "width": 176.23995971679688,
      "height": 189,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b17",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1200004995,
      "version": 154,
      "versionNonce": 1659136579,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1769584056658,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "无限状态\n   ↓\n图灵完备\n   ↓\n不可判定\n   ↓\n定理证明 / 人工参与",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "无限状态\n   ↓\n图灵完备\n   ↓\n不可判定\n   ↓\n定理证明 / 人工参与",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "1st_Sqh4M7q7fsLXQp3-y",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 57.54846181905111,
      "y": -246.5901207754123,
      "width": 192.68092346191406,
